8. SECURITY AND TRUST

8.1 Zero‑Trust Architecture

· Identity: SPIFFE IDs for every workload; SPIRE server on Triad nodes.
· Authentication: Mutual TLS for all gRPC/DDS; short‑lived certificates.
· Authorization: RBAC enforced at API endpoints; decentralised policy enforcement.

8.2 Quantum Security

· QKD: Entangled photon links between ring segments and Earth; keys mixed with AES‑256‑GCM.
· QRNG: Quantum random number generators on Triad nodes for critical keys.

8.3 Immutable Audit

Every decision that affects residents or system safety is logged to a permissioned blockchain (Hyperledger Fabric). Logs are anchored to Earth‑based systems for independent verification.

