10. CONCLUSION

The QUENNE Stacked Intelligence architecture provides a rigorous, implementable path to self‑governing space habitats. By aligning nine specialised layers – from quantum annealing to ethical reasoning – we demonstrate that autonomous cognition can be safe, transparent, and trustworthy. The Orbital Star Ring Smart City is not merely a concept; it is an engineering blueprint ready for prototyping.

We invite the global aerospace, AI, and policy communities to examine, critique, and refine this work. The path to becoming a multi‑planetary species is paved with intelligent infrastructures; the QUENNE Stack is a foundation stone.

